---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="儿童星级奖励系统">
  <div class="index-wrap">
    <h1>儿童星级奖励系统</h1>
    <p class="sub">封闭测试。家庭由邀请名单建立，没有公开注册。儿童用家庭码绑定设备，家长用魔法链接登录。</p>
    <div class="entry-row">
      <a class="entry-card" href="/kid">
        <span class="tag">/kid</span>
        <div class="name">儿童端</div>
        <div class="note">每日打卡加星，兑换奖励会先冻结星星，等家长确认。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="entry-card parent" href="/parent">
        <span class="tag">/parent</span>
        <div class="name">家长端</div>
        <div class="note">同意或拒绝兑换，管理任务和奖励。两位家长都能操作。</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
